# AI-generated art staged here for uploading to Roblox as Decals/Images --
# these are source material for the Creator Dashboard upload, not game
# code, and Roblox never loads images off disk anyway (only by asset id --
# see Client/ArtAssets.lua), so there's no reason to bloat the git history
# with multi-MB PNGs. Safe to delete this whole folder once every image in
# it has been uploaded and its asset id is recorded in ArtAssets.lua.
art-wip/
